# docs_everywhere (Ruby)

Ruby bindings for `docs_everywhere` using the [ffi](https://github.com/ffi/ffi) gem.

## Prerequisites

- Ruby 2.7 or newer
- The native library (`libdocs_everywhere.so`, `libdocs_everywhere.dylib`, or `docs_everywhere.dll`) on the library
  search path, or its path in the `DOCS_EVERYWHERE_LIBRARY` environment variable.

## Install

```bash
gem build docs_everywhere.gemspec
gem install docs_everywhere-0.1.0.gem
```

## Usage

```ruby
require 'docs_everywhere'

DocsEverywhere::ABI_VERSION
```

